@startuml live-check-test-architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "SF Pro Display"
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Weaver Live-Check Test Suite Architecture

package "Test Suite Entry Points" {
    [validate_test_setup.sh] as validate
    [run_test_subset.sh] as subset
    [test_live_check_comprehensive.sh] as main
}

package "Test Categories" {
    package "Basic Tests (30s)" {
        [01_file_json] as t1
        [02_stdin_text] as t2
        [03_json_output] as t3
        [04_ansi_output] as t4
    }

    package "Advanced Tests (60s)" {
        [05_inactivity_timeout] as t5
        [06_sighup_stop] as t6
        [07_custom_policies] as t7
        [08_statistics] as t8
    }

    package "Concurrent Tests (90s)" {
        [09_concurrent_instances] as t9
        [10_otlp_grpc] as t10
    }
}

package "Weaver Integration" {
    [weaver registry live-check] as weaver
    database "registry/" as registry
}

package "Output & Reporting" {
    folder "validation_output/live_check_tests/" {
        [test_run_*.log] as mainlog
        [test_summary.json] as summary
        folder "Individual Test Logs" as testlogs
        folder "Weaver Reports" as reports
    }
}

package "CI/CD Integration" {
    [GitHub Actions] as gh
    [Artifacts] as artifacts
    [Step Summary] as ghsummary
}

' Relationships - Entry Points
validate --> main : validates setup
subset --> main : runs subset
main --> t1
main --> t2
main --> t3
main --> t4
main --> t5
main --> t6
main --> t7
main --> t8
main --> t9
main --> t10

' Relationships - Tests to Weaver
t1 --> weaver : file input
t2 --> weaver : stdin input
t3 --> weaver : validates JSON
t4 --> weaver : validates ANSI
t5 --> weaver : tests timeout
t6 --> weaver : tests SIGHUP
t7 --> weaver : custom policies
t8 --> weaver : stats validation
t9 --> weaver : concurrent (x3)
t10 --> weaver : OTLP gRPC

' Weaver to Registry
weaver --> registry : validates against

' Output
weaver --> reports : generates
main --> mainlog : writes
main --> summary : generates
main --> testlogs : per-test logs

' CI/CD
gh --> validate : pre-flight
gh --> subset : --basic\n--advanced\n--concurrent
gh --> main : full suite
main --> artifacts : uploads
main --> ghsummary : generates

note right of validate
  Pre-flight checks:
  • weaver installed?
  • registry exists?
  • ports available?
  • jq installed?
  • cargo available?
end note

note right of weaver
  Live-check capabilities:
  • OTLP gRPC input
  • File input (JSON)
  • stdin input (text)
  • JSON output
  • ANSI output
  • Timeout behavior
  • Signal handling
  • Custom policies
  • Statistics
  • Concurrent operation
end note

note right of summary
  {
    "passed": 10,
    "failed": 0,
    "skipped": 0,
    "duration_seconds": 125,
    "passed_tests": [...],
    "failed_tests": [],
    "skipped_tests": []
  }
end note

legend right
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | → | Executes / Calls |
  | ..> | Validates Against |
  | --> | Writes Output |

  **Test Subsets**:
  • --quick: t1, t3 (15s)
  • --basic: t1-t4 (30s)
  • --advanced: t5-t8 (60s)
  • --concurrent: t9-t10 (90s)
  • --all: t1-t10 (2-3min)
endlegend

@enduml
